  <item>
    <title>30而「立」，30而已！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6900935d740634ca47690e96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6900935d740634ca47690e96</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 10:18:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一、内容介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>“偶尔会有点难过，觉得自己刚刚内心成熟，就已然走进了成年人的世界。可我还是喜欢30岁。我是自由的。我仍然热爱着我的31岁，能够做选择，非常有主见，有生生不息地力量。”——Phemia</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6mr4fEJlY7UoTapQtclYlZ7V6w.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>二、时点记录</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">00:05:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;「30岁的」身体先行……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">00:08:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;虽然成年很久了，但还不是个“大人”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">00:14:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我们的焦虑：生育啊、恋爱啊、婚姻啊、事业啊……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1432">00:23:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;插播一条心理咨询的安利</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>（我们逐渐开始边吃边录了，如果听感上给您带来不适，非常抱歉！）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">00:45:07</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;向下扎根，向上生长</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">00:54:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;友情维系的秘诀之一：谨慎点评穿衣风格</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">01:01:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大概不管到几十岁，我们都会关注自我成长吧~</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>三、主播介绍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>岩岩子：热爱运动且善变的岩岩子，设计师，美术学方向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>俊如：生命在于静止的俊如，实习心理咨询师，心理学方向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>晓欢：不断感受中的晓欢，用户体验研究员，心理学方向</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>四、后期制作</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：晓欢、俊如</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>文案：俊如</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>封面：岩岩</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>配乐：Gentle Feelings, by Serge Pavkin Music, from Pixabay Music</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6540c920f0a30901bf9c7a98/liKkIsFGjkG5OYWj5-5hF39NUaqi.m4a" length="140729634" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_yIShSEYsBDdhrweAul8OSOINP.png"/>
