  <item>
    <title>萌发于松弛｜《我的阿勒泰》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6684f2210bc5d7cc707c997a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6684f2210bc5d7cc707c997a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 06:39:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一、内容介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我的阿勒泰》松弛、简单而温情，阳光仿佛永远灿烂，但清风不燥。</span></p><span></span><p><span>除却美景外，这一期更多围绕两位很棒的父母，以及不太聪明的人类展开讨论。希望你听完之后，能感到轻松一点，再轻松一点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>二、主播介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>岩岩子：热爱运动且善变的岩岩子，设计师，设计学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>俊如：生命在于静止的蔡蔡子，心理咨询师，心理学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>晓欢：不断感受中的晓欢，用户体验研究员，心理学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>三、时间戳：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 阿勒泰的松弛感｜1 内地《小森林》 、2 对时间和规则的重新诠释</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 究竟怎样才算理想人生？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 张大侠｜母亲的自我过大，会吞没孩子吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 苏力坦｜放弃行使父权，给原生家庭的冲突带来希望</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> 人类文明前行的镇痛期，以一代人为单位</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 厌蠢情绪，也许潜藏着东亚文化的集体潜意识</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 做错事和做坏事不同，能像做事一样去承担犯错的后果就好</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>四、特别鸣谢</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：岩岩子、晓欢</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：晓欢</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Gentle Feelings, by Serge Pavkin Music, from Pixabay Music</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhcvDOcR68sDcvetq0UBLcc6bDmz.m4a" length="56096250" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwdqyseXOG7g4gIqwpOGB25JhS6.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>弗洛伊德：去爱、去工作｜《不够善良的我们》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665d6b4863c334a2fbfda26c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665d6b4863c334a2fbfda26c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Jun 2024 07:05:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一、内容介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期聊高分台剧《不够善良的我们》，剧中对于人物、人物间的关系以及他们在关系中的感受刻画得非常细腻，我们被深深触碰到，所以赶紧来和大家分享啦，也非常欢迎在评论区跟我们互动“观后感”～</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS：有剧透，介意的朋友看完剧再听哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>二、主播介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>岩岩子：热爱运动且善变的岩岩子，设计师，设计学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>俊如：生命在于静止的蔡蔡子，心理咨询师，心理学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>晓欢：不断感受中的晓欢，用户体验研究员，心理学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>三、时点记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">00:02:45</a> 叙事手法上大分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">00:05:16</a> 四个人的故事，怎么能没有何妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">00:13:49</a> 暗戳戳的绿茶呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">00:20:48</a> 如果说何是“健全的”，那么R是“没有手的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">00:23:18</a> 弱者，害人又害己？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">00:33:28</a> 人生之路不止两种，但都鲜花与荆棘并存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">00:36:11</a> 简庆芬们：去工作吧！（狗屁工作除外）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2852">00:47:32</a> Rebecca们：去爱吧！（人渣除外）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3616">01:00:16</a> 弱化自我的代价是，丧失生命的鲜活感呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4301">01:11:41</a> 离职照顾何妈妈，是简气势汹汹的善良</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4301">01:11:41</a> 简的肉体出轨，到底是为什么呀？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4927">01:22:07</a> 简和R，仿佛平行时空的彼此</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5286">01:28:06</a> 允许现任给前任留有一席之地吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5434">01:30:34</a> 关于结局——“我很爱我的老婆”</span></p><span></span><p><span>四、特别鸣谢</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：晓欢、岩岩子</span></p><span></span><p><span>文字：俊如</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：岩岩子</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Gentle Feelings, by Serge Pavkin Music, from Pixabay Music</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhwDbvZmUukTM4nsA02tL-7PEgRl.m4a" length="96481163" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:39:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlnQaxQG-i9Br2hJgy521hMKsKSc.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>解锁青甘环线</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66568ff306bc73decb1b4052</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66568ff306bc73decb1b4052</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 May 2024 02:16:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一、内容介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>3月初，岩岩子和晓欢解锁了青甘大环线，这一期我们就来聊聊这一路的见闻和感受。收听指南：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 大家可以配合下面行程的图文食用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 以下讨论均出自 “3月初”淡季的前提下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ps.原本想趁着春暖花开之际，给大家一些出游攻略，没想到拖着拖着就到了栀子花开的季节（俊如滑跪道歉🙇🏻‍♀️），那就作为毕业旅行攻略吧。春日短暂，初夏快乐啊朋友们！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第一天：西宁市-日月山-青海湖/黑马河-茶卡</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第二天：茶卡-柴达木盆地-翡翠湖-大柴旦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第三天：大柴旦-小柴旦湖-U形公路-水上雅丹-东台吉乃尔湖-魔鬼城-敦煌市</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第四天：敦煌-鸣沙山月牙泉 -摘星阁-敦煌市</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第五天：敦煌-敦煌书局-莫高窟-又见敦煌 -敦煌市</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第六天：敦煌-七彩丹霞-张掖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第七天：张掖-大佛寺-祁连山大草原-岗什卡雪峰-西宁市</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBJtVV22DRT6Kro0YjqbGHqT6Ci.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>二、主播介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>岩岩子：热爱运动且善变的岩岩子，设计师，设计方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>俊如：生命在于静止的蔡蔡子，心理咨询师，心理学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>晓欢：不断感受中的晓欢，用户体验研究员，心理学方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>三、时点记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">00:02:30</a> 行程概要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">00:03:40</a> 日月山：（3月的）求别骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">00:07:25</a> &nbsp;青海湖：内陆人民对草原生活的羡慕与担忧😂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">00:12:40</a> &nbsp;茶卡盐湖：去了但没完全去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">00:13:30</a> &nbsp;柴达木盆地：很平~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">00:14:00</a> &nbsp;翡翠湖：晓欢pick1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">00:17:00</a> &nbsp;小柴旦湖：冰湖危险，注意安全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">00:19:50</a> &nbsp;315 U型公路：想带回一团风滚草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">00:21:00</a> &nbsp;水上雅丹：欢迎来到“地球尽头”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">00:26:00</a> &nbsp;东台吉乃尔湖：晓欢pick 2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">00:27:40</a> &nbsp;魔鬼城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">00:29:10</a> &nbsp;鸣沙山/月牙泉：错过了沙漠日落与星河！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">00:30:30</a> &nbsp;摘星阁：岩岩子pick 1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">00:34:10</a> &nbsp;敦煌书局：知识点补给站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">00:37:00</a> &nbsp;莫高窟：岩岩子pick 2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">00:48:40</a> &nbsp;又见敦煌：美味的预制菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">00:52:20</a> &nbsp;敦煌夜市：不要在第一家买！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">00:55:50</a> &nbsp;七彩丹霞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">00:58:10</a> &nbsp;大佛寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">00:59:30</a> &nbsp;祁连山骑马：讲价对齐颗粒度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">01:02:00</a> &nbsp;极限二选一：淡季or旺季</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3930">01:05:30</a> &nbsp;是经过旅游考验的友谊了</span></p><span></span><p><span>四、特别鸣谢</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：晓欢、俊如、岩岩子</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：晓欢和岩岩子的合照</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Gentle Feelings, by </span><a href="https://pixabay.com/zh/users/sergepavkinmusic-6130722/" data-url="https://pixabay.com/zh/users/sergepavkinmusic-6130722/"><span>Serge Pavkin Music</span></a><span> , from Pixabay Music</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpWq268nkuSdZaQfpx-Oso7vKEAx.m4a" length="71494502" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkZQg35SvVyYq3F4ynb3QGfoFkSm.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>变化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e51675cfdcad8d2c5e00b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e51675cfdcad8d2c5e00b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Mar 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一、内容介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期浅聊【变化】。</span></p><span></span><p><span>初入社会的几年，相信对每个人都是一段“兵荒马乱”的时光，与之相随的内在心态和物理空间各有变化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>近来，我们三个渐渐平稳，过往的经历呈现出了更清晰的轮廓。欢迎在评论区和我们一起回溯这几年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>二、主播介绍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>岩岩子：热爱运动且善变的岩岩子，设计师，设计方向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>俊如：生命在于静止的蔡蔡子，心理咨询师，心理学方向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>晓欢：不断感受中的晓欢，用户体验研究员，心理学方向</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>三、时点记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 离开北京，卸下重负，让情绪感受流淌起来~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 朋辈压力真的是促使我们更快进步的动因吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 不要讨论我的年龄！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 自我pua：合理化长距离通勤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 回到家乡省会城市的归属感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 从攒钱到月光，消费观的大反转会给内心带来什么变化？（仅供参考，谨慎效仿）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 我们在倒着生长：先满足生存需求，再丰满内心世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 我要长成一颗独立的树啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>四、特别鸣谢</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>策划：岩岩子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：岩岩子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>封面：岩岩子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>配乐：Gentle Feelings, by </span><a href="https://pixabay.com/zh/users/sergepavkinmusic-6130722/" data-url="https://pixabay.com/zh/users/sergepavkinmusic-6130722/"><span>SergePavkinMusic</span></a><span> , from Pixabay Music</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
